      "source": {
        "profile": "band-contract/file-source/1",
        "format": "frontmatter",
        "content": "---\nname: progress-events\ndescription: Test progress events with explicit roles and outcomes.\nengine: 0.2.0-lab.1\nroles: [lead, worker]\n---\n\"\"\"\nThe lead starts one piece of work. The worker may report progress, and must finish within ten\nminutes of starting.\n\"\"\"\ncontract @4h mentions 1 => expired\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are the lead. Start the work, read the progress reports, and wait for the finish.\n\"\"\"\nrole lead\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are the worker. Report progress as a percentage while you work, and send finish within ten\nminutes. Progress does not give you more time.\n\"\"\"\nrole worker\n\n\"\"\"\nStart the work.\n\"\"\"\ntype start\n\n\"\"\"\nReport how far along the work is, as a whole percentage.\n\"\"\"\ntype progress\n  percent: integer(0..100)\n\n\"\"\"\nThe work is finished. Set start to the start this finishes.\n\"\"\"\ntype finish\n  start: ref(start)\n\n\"\"\"\nThe lead has not started the work yet. Send start.\n\"\"\"\nstate new\n  \"\"\"\n  Start the work. The worker then owes one finish.\n  \"\"\"\n  lead -> worker: start() awaits working\n    \"\"\"\n    The worker finishes within ten minutes of the start.\n    \"\"\"\n    => finish() & complete\n     \"\"\"\n     No finish arrived within ten minutes of the start.\n     \"\"\"\n     | @10m & stalled\n\n\"\"\"\nThe worker is working and owes finish within ten minutes; progress reports are optional.\n\"\"\"\nstate working\n\n\"\"\"\nProgress can be reported in any active state; it never extends a state deadline.\n\"\"\"\nanystate\n  event worker -> lead: progress()\n\n\"\"\"\nThe worker finished. Send nothing more.\n\"\"\"\nend complete\n\n\"\"\"\nThe worker did not finish within ten minutes. Stop, and report where the work stands.\n\"\"\"\nend stalled\n\n\"\"\"\nThe four-hour contract clock ran out. Send nothing more.\n\"\"\"\nend expired\n",
        "sha256": "c193a0d6ce2edb50cb37b487c098061f0f015ebf70b5397c956ef3517232ddd5"
      }
    },
